<title>MALAYSIA: Hock Hua Bank 6-mth net up 23.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Hock Hua Bank 6-mth net up 23.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		  (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     37.48	 vs     30.34</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)    30.6	  vs     24.9</p>
<p>    Turnover	     208.90	 vs     162.15</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	59.09	 vs	47.88</p>
<p>    Minorities	     3.02	 vs	 1.92</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Hock Hua Bank Bhd.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 201 4813)</p>
</text>
